---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Playground — Quire"
  description="Drop a .docx and the browser renders it with the same Rust engine, compiled to WebAssembly. Read-only beta running entirely in-tab with pure File API."
  path="/playground"
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span class="tick">●</span> WASM Playground — Read-only Beta</p>
      <h1>Drop a <code>.docx</code>. Render it in your browser.</h1>
      <p class="sub">
        The same Rust core as the CLI, compiled to <code>wasm32-unknown-unknown</code>,
        running entirely in your tab — no upload, no server, the bytes never leave the page.
        This beta provides in-browser read-only pagination and Canvas2D rendering.
      </p>
      <p class="budget-callout">
        <span class="chip-sm">WASM Payload</span>
        約 1.57 MB raw（實測 gzip 壓縮後 910 KB），僅在造訪此頁時串流載入一次，之後走瀏覽器本機快取；全站其餘頁面完全不包含此 WASM 負載。
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap">
    <!-- 拖放與選檔區域 -->
    <div class="dropzone" id="dropzone" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="選取或拖曳 .docx 檔案進入此區域">
      <input type="file" id="file-input" accept=".docx" style="display: none;" aria-hidden="true" />
      <span class="chip" id="wasm-status-chip">載入中 · WASM 流式編譯</span>
      <p class="dz-title">拖放本機 <code>.docx</code> 檔案至此，或點擊選取檔案</p>
      <p class="dz-sub" id="status-desc">
        正在自本站取得 WASM 引擎（約 1.57 MB / Gzip 實測 910 KB）…
      </p>

      <!-- 流式下載進度條 -->
      <div class="progress-wrap" id="progress-wrap">
        <div class="progress-bar" id="progress-bar"></div>
      </div>

      <p class="privacy-note">
        <strong>純本機 File API 讀取：</strong>所有位元組皆在瀏覽器分頁內就地解析與排版，絕不上傳至任何伺服器。
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 具體錯誤警示面板（預設隱藏） -->
    <div class="error-panel" id="error-panel" hidden role="alert">
      <div class="error-header">
        <span class="error-badge">渲染失敗</span>
        <strong id="error-type">解析錯誤</strong>
      </div>
      <p class="error-detail" id="error-detail">錯誤詳細說明</p>
      <p class="error-hint">
        本引擎以真實排版管線回報狀態，絕不隱瞞或假稱成功。請確認檔案是否符合標準 Office Open XML (DOCX) 格式規範。
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 唯讀畫布與分頁檢視面板（預設隱藏） -->
    <div class="viewer-panel" id="viewer-panel" hidden>
      <div class="viewer-toolbar">
        <div class="toolbar-left">
          <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-ghost" id="prev-page-btn" disabled>◀ 上一頁</button>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-ghost" id="next-page-btn" disabled>下一頁 ▶</button>
          <span class="page-info" id="page-info">第 1 / 1 頁</span>
        </div>
        <div class="toolbar-right">
          <span class="doc-meta" id="doc-meta">全篇共 0 個段落</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="canvas-viewport" id="canvas-viewport">
        <canvas id="render-canvas"></canvas>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap" aria-labelledby="spec-h">
    <h2 id="spec-h">What the playground does</h2>
    <table class="spec">
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <th scope="row">Input</th>
          <td>A local <code>.docx</code>, read in-tab with the File API. Nothing is uploaded.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th scope="row">Engine</th>
          <td>The <code>shells/web</code> wasm build — a thin adapter over the same core the CLI uses, streamed on first load with progress reported.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th scope="row">Output</th>
          <td>Line-break points and page splits from the real layout pass: shaped advances against real font metrics, Knuth-Plass breaks, pagination per <code>sectPr</code> geometry.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th scope="row">Editing</th>
          <td>
            <strong>Read-only in beta.</strong>
            Caret placement, text selection, and incremental IME typing reflow are deferred to subsequent releases (the invisible anchor contract is established in the web shell; this beta focuses strictly on faithful page rendering).
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th scope="row">Budget</th>
          <td>First wasm payload stays under its budget (~1.57 MB raw, 910 KB gzip, cached once on-demand); the collaboration layer is a separate deferred chunk.</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap" aria-labelledby="status-h">
    <h2 id="status-h">Status & Beta Scope</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>Read-only Beta is live.</strong>
      The playground now executes the real <code>shells/web</code> WebAssembly engine
      directly inside your browser tab without any server-side round-trips.
    </p>
    <div class="status-grid">
      <div class="status-card">
        <h3>已驗證語料與規模 (Verified Corpus)</h3>
        <p>
          排版核心在 CI 中經 399 份真實世界 DOCX 語料逐檔驗證，涵蓋單頁備忘錄至數 MB 的技術手冊
          （含 LibreOffice 導出語料如 <code>fdo68607.docx</code>），存回時不動位元組百分之百一致（byte-identical）。
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="status-card">
        <h3>本版支援功能 (Supported in Beta)</h3>
        <p>
          Knuth-Plass 段落最佳斷行、UAX#14 斷字規則、<code>sectPr</code> 逐頁幾何尺寸、
          表格跨頁切頁、頁首頁尾欄位代換、樣式級聯（docDefaults → basedOn → 直接格式）、
          圖片佔位與強制分頁（<code>w:br type="page"</code>）。
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="status-card">
        <h3>已知限制 (Known Limitations)</h3>
        <ul class="limitations-list">
          <li><strong>唯讀渲染：</strong>本版本不含游標定位、文字選取與 IME 增量輸入。</li>
          <li><strong>未支援版面：</strong>多欄排版（<code>w:cols</code>）與修訂追蹤（tracked changes）尚未實作。</li>
          <li><strong>複雜圖形：</strong>DrawingML 向量幾何形狀與 SmartArt 為已知視覺缺口，以語料失敗簇持續追蹤。</li>
          <li><strong>字型繪製：</strong>瀏覽器 Canvas2D 目前搭配系統/備援字型渲染，與 native 端的 HarfBuzz/swash 度量存在些微視覺差異。</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 缺資產守門：quire_web.js 缺檔時模組載入直接失敗、重磅模組不會執行，
       故用獨立 inline 腳本偵測資產 404 並顯示具體補救指示（不與引擎錯誤混淆） -->
  <script is:inline>
    (function () {
      "use strict";
      var MISSING_HINT =
        "此站點建置缺少 WASM 引擎資產（public/playground/ 下的 quire_web_bg.wasm / quire_web.js）。\n" +
        "引擎二進位不進網頁 repo，需 build 前先取得：在本 repo 根目錄執行\n" +
        "「npm run fetch:wasm」，腳本會自 GitHub release 下載（失敗時自動降級本機建置），\n" +
        "完成後重新 npm run build && npm run preview。詳見 public/playground/MISSING-ASSETS.md 與 README。";
      function indicateMissingAssets(which) {
        var chip = document.getElementById("wasm-status-chip");
        var desc = document.getElementById("status-desc");
        var panel = document.getElementById("error-panel");
        var detail = document.getElementById("error-detail");
        var type = document.getElementById("error-type");
        if (chip) {
          chip.textContent = "缺資產 · 引擎未就緒";
          chip.className = "chip chip-error";
        }
        if (desc) desc.textContent = "WASM 引擎資產缺失（" + which + " 404），無法啟動渲染。";
        if (type) type.textContent = "引擎資產缺失";
        if (detail) detail.textContent = MISSING_HINT;
        if (panel) panel.hidden = false;
        var wrap = document.getElementById("progress-wrap");
        if (wrap) wrap.hidden = true;
      }
      function check(a, b) {
        fetch("/playground/" + a, { method: "HEAD" })
          .then(function (r1) {
            if (r1.status !== 404) return;
            fetch("/playground/" + b, { method: "HEAD" }).then(function (r2) {
              var bad = r1.status === 404 ? a : r2.status === 404 ? b : null;
              if (bad) indicateMissingAssets(bad);
            });
          })
          .catch(function () {}); // 網路層失敗交由引擎模組自身的錯誤面板處理
      }
      window.addEventListener("load", function () {
        setTimeout(function () { check("quire_web_bg.wasm", "quire_web.js"); }, 400);
      });
    })();
  </script>
  <!-- 引入 Playground 模組化驅動腳本 -->
  <script type="module" src="/playground/playground.js"></script>
</Base>

<style>
  /* Playground 專屬樣式（Scoped） */
  .budget-callout {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--rule);
    padding-left: 0.8rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .chip-sm {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    padding: 0.1rem 0.4rem;
    margin-right: 0.4rem;
    vertical-align: middle;
  }

  /* 中文跑版修正：dropzone 訊息區塊一律左對齊＋行距 1.6 起，
     不得出現「預/覽」式標點鋸字或 URL 反引號撕裂整段 */
  .dropzone .dz-title,
  .dropzone .dz-sub,
  .dropzone .privacy-note {
    text-align: left;
    line-height: 1.6;
    word-break: normal;
    overflow-wrap: break-word;
    line-break: strict;
  }

  .dropzone .dz-sub {
    margin-inline: 0 auto; /* 區塊靠左收窄，不再整段偏右飄 */
  }

  .dropzone .progress-wrap {
    margin-left: 0;
  }

  .dropzone {
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: border-color 0.18s ease, background-color 0.18s ease;
    user-select: none;
    outline: none;
  }

  .dropzone:hover,
  .dropzone:focus-visible,
  .dropzone.drag-over {
    border-color: var(--fg);
    background-color: var(--panel-hover, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04));
  }

  .chip-ready {
    border-color: #2b8a3e;
    color: #2b8a3e;
  }

  .chip-success {
    border-color: #2f9e44;
    color: #2f9e44;
  }

  .chip-error {
    border-color: #e03131;
    color: #e03131;
  }

  .progress-wrap {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 320px;
    height: 4px;
    background: var(--rule);
    margin: 1rem auto 0.6rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  .progress-bar {
    width: 0%;
    height: 100%;
    background: var(--fg);
    transition: width 0.12s ease;
  }

  .privacy-note {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-top: 1.2rem;
    /* 行內截圖實證：mono＋中文混排最易鋸行——左對齊＋行距 1.6＋禁則化折行 */
    line-height: 1.7;
    word-break: normal;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere; /* 允許長檔名/URL 折行，但絕不撐破容器 */
    line-break: strict;
  }

  .privacy-note strong {
    color: var(--fg);
  }

  /* 錯誤面板 */
  .error-panel {
    border: 1px solid #e03131;
    background: rgba(224, 49, 49, 0.06);
    padding: 1.2rem 1.5rem;
    margin-block: 1.5rem;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .error-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .error-badge {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    background: #e03131;
    color: #fff;
    padding: 0.15rem 0.45rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .error-detail {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #c92a2a;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    /* 原 word-break: break-all 會把 URL/檔名從任意字元撕行；改 anywhere 保留
       長字串可折行的能力，僅在確實會溢出時才斷，正常中文不鋸字 */
    word-break: normal;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    white-space: pre-line; /* 引擎指示訊息保留 \n 換行，閱讀性優先 */
  }

  .error-hint {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* 預覽面板與工具列 */
  .viewer-panel {
    margin-block: 2rem;
  }

  .viewer-toolbar {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    background: var(--panel);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
  }

  .toolbar-left {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  .btn-sm {
    padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .btn-sm:disabled {
    opacity: 0.35;
    cursor: not-allowed;
    border-color: var(--rule);
  }

  .page-info {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-left: 0.4rem;
  }

  .toolbar-right {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  /* 截圖實證：「（22.6 KB)，全篇共 11 頁。可在下方翻頁預 覽。」被右對齊＋
     mono 折行鋸開——改左對齊、禁則化折行、行距 1.6，允許在必要時折成兩行 */
  .doc-meta {
    display: inline-block;
    text-align: left;
    line-height: 1.6;
    white-space: normal;
    word-break: normal;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    line-break: strict;
    max-width: 32rem;
  }

  .canvas-viewport {
    background: #2a2a2a;
    padding: 2rem 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    overflow-x: auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .canvas-viewport canvas {
    box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
    max-width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: inline-block;
    background: #ffffff;
  }

  /* Status 區塊網格 */
  .status-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.2rem;
    margin-top: 1.2rem;
  }

  .status-card {
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    background: var(--panel);
    padding: 1.2rem 1.4rem;
  }

  .status-card h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .status-card p {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin: 0;
    word-break: normal;
    overflow-wrap: break-word;
    line-break: strict;
  }

  .limitations-list {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.1rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--muted);
    word-break: normal;
    overflow-wrap: break-word;
    line-break: strict;
  }

  .limitations-list li {
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  /* 手機窄屏（≤640px）：mixed mono/CJK 進一步確保不單字撐爆、不鋸字 */
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .dropzone .dz-title {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
    }

    .dropzone .dz-sub,
    .budget-callout,
    .privacy-note {
      font-size: 0.74rem;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }

    .viewer-toolbar {
      align-items: flex-start;
    }

    .toolbar-right,
    .doc-meta {
      text-align: left;
      max-width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
